#### 4.2.1 API Gateway (Regional Endpoint)

> **🔒 Generated by the Golden Path Module:** The configuration below reflects what the `terraform-aws-apigateway-compliant` module (§9.8.1) provisions. Teams supply `api_name`, `openapi_spec`, `vpc_link_arn`, `stage_name`, and optional throttle inputs; the module enforces all security-sensitive settings (log format, `dataTraceEnabled = false`, WAF association) as non-configurable constants.

```json
{
  "name": "medicaid-eligibility-api",
  "endpointConfiguration": {
    "types": ["REGIONAL"]
  },
  "stage": {
    "stageName": "prod",
    "throttleSettings": {
      "burstLimit": 5000,
      "rateLimit": 2000
    },
    "accessLogSettings": {
      "destinationArn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-1:123456789012:log-group:/aws/apigateway/medicaid-eligibility-api",
      "format": "$context.requestId $context.identity.sourceIp ..."
    },
    "methodSettings": {
      "*/*": {
        "loggingLevel": "INFO",
        "dataTraceEnabled": false,
        "metricsEnabled": true
      }
    }
  }
}
```

